{"id":"n37302-2-8","stage":5,"title":"궂다 · (事情或状况)不好","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37302-2-8-1","ko":"민준 씨는 일이 궂어도 항상 웃음을 잃지 않아요.","zh":"敏俊即使干脏活累活，也总是面带笑容。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨는","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"궂어도","meaning":"(事情或状况)不好","explanation":"궂다：(事情或状况)不好；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"궂다","audio":"/audio/7104d084b525de5efb6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37302","senseId":"2","lemma":"궂다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웃음을","meaning":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","explanation":"웃음：笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"웃음","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49095","senseId":"1","lemma":"웃음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃지","meaning":"失去","explanation":"잃다：失去；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"7","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"7104d084b525de5e","term":"궂다","zh":"(事情或状况)不好","audio":"/audio/7104d084b525de5efb6f.mp3","entryId":"37302","definition":"艰苦、脏或讨厌。","pronunciation":["굳따"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"4f5bbfbe21d3bba8","term":"웃음","zh":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3","entryId":"49095","definition":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","pronunciation":["우슴"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"失去","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"意识、感情、精力或生理现象等消失。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c18f9da78a5a2450250.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37302-2-8-2","ko":"그래서 민준 씨가 회사 사람들 사이에서 평이 좋군요.","zh":"难怪他在同事中口碑那么好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊","readings":[{"term":"민준","audio":"/audio/905d70b1f90f9cbfa6dc.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"씨가","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이에서","meaning":"关系","explanation":"사이：关系；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"4","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평이","meaning":"评，评价，评论","explanation":"평：评，评价，评论；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"평","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88046","senseId":"1","lemma":"평","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋군요.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"关系","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"相互结交的关系或结交后亲密的程度。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"217dca5b5e978f0b","term":"평","zh":"评，评价，评论","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3","entryId":"88046","definition":"评判好坏、优劣、对错等；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["평ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5bccf1db01e9901fa7dd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.369,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37302","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.1957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["难怪他在同事中口碑那么好。","今天钓鱼怎么这么不顺啊。","敏俊即使干脏活累活，也总是面带笑容。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["难怪他在同事中口碑那么好。","敏俊即使干脏活累活，也总是面带笑容。","今天钓鱼怎么这么不顺啊。"],"answer":0}]}
